<title>SWEDEN: Sweden sets auction of 20 bln SKR 7-day T-bills.</title>
<headline>Sweden sets auction of 20 bln SKR 7-day T-bills.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden's National Debt Office said on Tuesday it would invite bids from the market for an auction of seven-day Treasury bills worth 20 billion crowns.</p>
<p>The office said all bids must be left by 1000 GMT on February 4 at the latest with the paper maturing on February 12. The lowest accepted bid volume is 100 million crowns.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-101</p>
